cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this research bridge using the metadata below."
title: "Covariant Refinement-Fiber Dynamics: Symmetry Classification, Constraint Closure, Backreaction, and Radiative Bounds"
type: book
authors:
  - family-names: "P."
    given-names: "Komorebi"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-08-19
repository-code: "https://github.com/KomorebiP/Operation-KOMOREBI"
abstract: >-
  A technical bridge for projector-refinement physics that develops a
  finite-depth covariant refinement-fiber action, canonical constraint
  closure, arbitrary-order production formulas, fixed-prime Mellin
  corrections, an energy-backreaction obstruction for the frozen
  cosmological benchmark, and finite-depth radiative bounds.
keywords:
  - projector refinement
  - covariant effective field theory
  - constraint algebra
  - backreaction
  - particle production
  - Mellin analysis
  - radiative stability
